  "description": "Paddle Billing adapter: webhook signature verification and canonical event mapping. Like\n      VKSubscription.Provider.Stripe, implemented with only BCL/ASP.NET Core shared-framework APIs\n      (System.Security.Cryptography, System.Text.Json) - no Paddle SDK dependency - so this project\n      restores and builds with zero NuGet access. Verifies the \"Paddle-Signature\" header exactly per\n      Paddle's documented scheme: HMAC-SHA256 over \"{ts}:{rawBody}\", hex-encoded, compared to the\n      header's \"h1\" value (see PaddleBillingProviderAdapter's doc comment for the source).",
